Q: What are the number of combinations of 7 numbers (6 distinct digits) Given a set of seven integers with the following restrictions:
the first and last number must be different;
the second and last number must be different;
the first and the third number must be different;
the second and third number must be different.
So there are 12 possibilities to do that.

